{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26965","headline":"酬礼部李员外见寄 · 姚合","name":"酬礼部李员外见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本求仙郡是闲居，岂向郎官更有书。\n溪石谁思玉匠爱，烟鸿愿与弋人疎。\n自来江上眠方稳，旧在城中病悉除。\n唯见君诗难便舍，寒宵吟到晓更初。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}